{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rev-22-1","title":"Revelation 22:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The river of the water of life. 2 The tree of life. 5 The light of the city of God is himself. 9 The angel will not be worshipped. 18 Nothing may be added to the word of God, nor taken therefrom.</p>\n<p>A pure. Ps 36:8; 46:4; Isa 41:18; 48:18; 66:12; Eze 47:1-9; Zec 14:8 Joh 7:38,39 water. 7:17; 21:6; Ps 36:9; Jer 2:13; 17:13; Joh 4:10,11,14 clear. 21:11 proceeding. 3:21; 4:5; 5:6,13; 7:10,11,17; Joh 14:16-18; 15:26; 16:7-15 Ac 1:4,5; 2:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-2","title":"Revelation 22:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>the midst. 1; 21:21; Eze 47:1,12 the tree of life.Rather, the definite article not being in the original, \"a tree of life;\" for there were three trees; one in the street, and one on each side of the river.</p>\n<p>14; 2:7; Ge 2:9; 3:22-24; Pr 3:18 healing. 21:24; Ps 147:3; Isa 6:10; 57:18,19; Jer 17:14; Eze 47:8-11; Ho 14:4 Mal 4:2; Lu 4:18; 1Pe 2:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-3","title":"Revelation 22:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>there. 21:4; De 27:26; Zec 14:11; Mt 25:41; Ge 3:10-13; Eze 37:27 but. 7:15-17; 21:22,23; Ps 16:11; 17:15; Isa 12:6; Eze 48:35; Mt 25:21 Joh 14:3; 17:24 his. 7:15; Joh 12:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-4","title":"Revelation 22:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>they. Eze 33:18-20,23; Job 33:26; Ps 4:6; Isa 33:17; 35:2; 40:5; Mt 5:8 Joh 12:26; 17:24; 1Co 13:12; Heb 12:14; 1Jo 3:2,3 and his. 3:12; 14:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-5","title":"Revelation 22:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>no night. 18:23; 21:22-25; Ps 36:9; 84:11; Pr 4:18,19; Isa 60:19,20 and they. 3:21; 11:15; Da 7:18,27; Mt 25:34,46; Ro 5:17; 2Ti 2:12; 1Pe 1:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-6","title":"Revelation 22:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>These. 19:9; 21:5 the holy. 18:20; Lu 1:70; 16:16; Ac 3:18; Ro 1:2; 1Pe 1:11,12; 2Pe 1:21; 3:2 sent. 1:1; Da 3:28; 6:22; Mt 13:41; Ac 12:11; 2Th 1:7 which. 7; Ge 41:32; 1Co 7:29; 2Pe 3:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-7","title":"Revelation 22:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>I come. 10,12,20; 3:11 blessed. 9; 1:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-8","title":"Revelation 22:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>I fell. 19:10,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-9","title":"Revelation 22:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>See. 19:10; De 4:19; Col 2:18,19; 1Jo 5:20 worship God. 4:10; 9:20; 14:7; 15:4; Ex 34:14; 2Ki 17:36; Ps 45:11; Mt 4:9; Lu 4:7 Joh 4:22,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-10","title":"Revelation 22:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>he saith. 12,13,16,20 Seal. 5:1; 10:4; Isa 8:16; Da 8:26; 12:4,9; Mt 10:27 for. 1:3; Isa 13:6; Eze 12:23; Ro 13:12; 2Th 2:3; 1Pe 4:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-11","title":"Revelation 22:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>that is unjust. 16:8-11,21; Ps 81:12; Pr 1:24-33; 14:32; Ec 11:3; Eze 3:27; Da 12:10 Mt 15:14; 21:19; 25:10; Joh 8:21; 2Ti 3:13 and he that. 3; 7:13-15; Job 17:9; Pr 4:18; Mt 5:6; Eph 5:27; Col 1:22; Jude 1:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-12","title":"Revelation 22:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>I come. 7; Zep 1:14 and my. 11:18; Isa 3:10,11; 40:10; 62:11; 1Co 3:8,14; 9:17,18 to give. 20:12; Mt 16:27; Ro 2:6-11; 14:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-13","title":"Revelation 22:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>1:8,11; 21:6; Isa 41:4; 44:6; 48:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-14","title":"Revelation 22:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Blessed. 7; Ps 106:3-5; 112:1; 119:1-6; Isa 56:1,2; Da 12:12; Mt 7:21-27 Lu 12:37,38; Joh 14:15,21-23; 15:10-14; 1Co 7:19; Ga 5:6 1Jo 3:3,23,24; 5:3 may have. Joh 4:12; 1Co 8:9; 9:5; *Gr: to the. 2; 2:7 and may. 21:27; Joh 10:7,9; 14:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-15","title":"Revelation 22:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>without. 9:20,21; 21:8,27; 1Co 6:9,10; Ga 5:19-21; Eph 5:3-6; Col 3:6 dogs. Php 3:2 sorcerers. 9:21; 18:23; Isa 47:9,12; 57:3; Mal 3:5; Ac 8:11; 13:6-11 whoremongers. 17:1-6 whosoever. 21:8,27; 1Ki 22:8,21-23; Isa 9:15,16; Jer 5:31; Joh 3:18-21 Joh 8:46; 2Th 2:10-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-16","title":"Revelation 22:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>I Jesus. 6; 1:1 to testify. 20 See on ver. 1,11; 2:7,11,17,29; 3:6,13,22 I am. 5:5; Isa 11:1; Zec 6:12; Mt 22:42,45; Ro 1:3,4; 9:5 the bright. 2:28; Nu 24:17; Mt 2:2,7-10; Lu 1:78; 2Pe 1:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-17","title":"Revelation 22:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>the Spirit. 16; Isa 55:1-3; Joh 16:7-15 the bride. 21:2,9 Come. Isa 2:5 let him that heareth. Ps 34:8; Isa 2:3,5; 48:16-18; Jer 50:5; Mic 4:2; Zec 8:21-23 Joh 1:39-46; 4:29; 1Th 1:5-8 let him that is athirst. 21:6; Isa 55:1; Joh 7:37 let him take. Isa 12:3; Joh 4:10,14 freely. Ro 3:24; 1Co 2:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-18","title":"Revelation 22:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>testify. 16; 3:14; Eph 4:17; 1Th 4:6 heareth. 1:3 If. De 4:2; 12:32; Pr 30:6; Mt 15:6-9,13 God. 14:10,11; 15:1; 16:1; 19:20; 20:10,15; Le 26:18,24,25,28,37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-19","title":"Revelation 22:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>take. 2:18; Lu 11:52 God. 3:5; 13:8; Ex 32:33; Ps 69:28 out of the book of life. or, from the tree of life. 2 and out. 21:2,22-27 and from. 12; 1:3; 2:7,11,17,26; 3:4,5,12,21; 7:9-17; 14:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-22-20","title":"Revelation 22:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>which. 18 Surely. 7,10,12 Amen. 1:18; So 8:14; Isa 25:9; Joh 21:25; 2Ti 4:8; Heb 9:28; 2Pe 3:12-14</p>"}]}